edge_cases:
- id: EC_K1_001
  case: Opening or reading the pre-experiment journal never advances manuscript time or grants ResearchProgress, including on repeated access.
- id: EC_K1_002
  case: Player idles in laboratory/street/house; manuscript clock does not advance.
- id: EC_K1_003
  case: Player selects FAST/RISKY/PRECISE then reloads; committed method and authored time restore from checkpoint without
    duplicate mastery credit.
- id: EC_K1_004
  case: Serum overdose occurs before transformation; reload routes to CP_K1_START.
- id: EC_K1_005
  case: NO_TIMER accessibility is active during beggar choice; timeout violence is disabled.
- id: EC_K1_006
  case: Player never interacts with optional postbox; Rook sequence remains reachable.
- id: EC_K1_007
  case: Player destroys postbox; no global destruction stat or new branch is invented.
- id: EC_K1_008
  case: Rook live-choice timer expires; ATTACK is selected automatically unless NO_TIMER is active.
- id: EC_K1_009
  case: Player attempts to walk away during Rook live approach; encounter geometry/actor behavior keeps the conflict live
    without cinematic lock.
- id: EC_K1_010
  case: ROAR/SPEAK/ATTACK opening variants all converge to the canonical first stab.
- id: EC_K1_011
  case: Canonical first stab cannot kill Hyde and cannot be parried away.
- id: EC_K1_012
  case: After the canonical first stab, a second clean penetrating knife hit kills Hyde and reloads CP_K1_POST_TRANSFORM.
- id: EC_K1_013
  case: Nonpenetrating Rook impacts do not increment K1HydeKnifeHits.
- id: EC_K1_014
  case: No visible health bar is required for either Hyde or Rook; debug may still expose hidden condition state.
- id: EC_K1_015
  case: Rook becomes incapacitated but knife remains within reach; THREAT_ENDED cannot commit until attack capability is truly
    gone.
- id: EC_K1_016
  case: Player continues striking during a near-loss state; telemetry may push style toward BRUTAL but fixed death still waits
    for explicit THREAT_ENDED.
- id: EC_K1_017
  case: Post-fight expression timer expires; SILENCE resolves by default.
