    from systemic combat telemetry.
  required_fix: Change story.K1 K1_ROOK contract from player-facing route choice to inferred resolver while preserving current
    consequence tables unless intentionally retuned.
- id: GLOBAL_COMBAT_SYSTEM
  status: REQUIRES_MASTER_SYNC
  issue: K1 v1.5 depends on systemic dodge/parry-deflect/strike/grab combat, hidden condition states and no mandatory health
    bars.
  required_fix: Add a minimal global combat_system contract to Master; keep exact frame/tuning data downstream.
- id: HYDE_GREEN_BLOOD_AND_REVERSION_PHYSIOLOGY
  status: REQUIRES_MASTER_SYNC
  issue: K1 v1.5 canonically gives Hyde green blood, one survivable penetrating wound, and no corresponding Jekyll wound/scar
    after overnight reversion while shed blood persists.
  required_fix: Add global/form-physiology evidence rule or explicitly scope this as the canonical K1 first-wound precedent.
