  status: REQUIRES_MASTER_OR_NARRATIVE_FLOW_SYNC
  issue: K1 no longer plays an escape/reversion route. It fades after Rook and resolves a non-magical offscreen reversion
    before Day-2 wake.
  required_fix: Replace K1 playable reversion beat while retaining the invariant that reversion is non-magical and not a blackout.
- id: K1_OPTIONAL_NEWSPAPER_AND_RELIEF
  status: REQUIRES_NARRATIVE_FLOW_AND_MASTER_SYNC
  issue: Newspaper/ÚLEVA are optional in v1.5; skipping them resolves ÚLEVA as MISSED and does not block K1.
  required_fix: Remove forced-news/forced-relief K1 requirement and make interpretation conditional on relief.
- id: K1_INITIAL_CRIME_SCENE_CONSULTATION
  status: REQUIRES_MASTER_AND_K2_SYNC
  issue: K1 now ends with an initial Newcomen consultation at the Rook scene instead of only a summons. K2 should retain broader
    follow-up investigation rather than duplicating the same first visit.
  required_fix: Adjust story.K1/story.K2 topology and Narrative Flow division of police investigation.
